{"id":"8-10","altIds":[],"chapter":8,"name":"AdaptThink 配套说明","title":"AdaptThink——学会 “何时不思考”","type":"runnable","typeLabel":"可运行","stars":2,"summary":"历史训练报告记录公开 W&B 主运行 wubbn5tj：8×H100，step 300 三基准响应长度均显著下降，但 AIME mean@16 下降 0.42 pp；运行继续至 step 410 后崩溃，checkpoint 不随书分发，且未保留独立 checkpoint 评估回执","path":"chapter8/AdaptThink","external":false,"status":"Checkpoint-free [training report](AdaptThink/TRAINING_REPORT.md) records public W&B runs `wubbn5tj` (main) and `dblyx7cm","statusNote":"**Complete checkpoint-free training report**","readme":[{"kind":"heading","depth":2,"text":"Experiment 8-10 reproduction anchor","id":"rh-1"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"简单问题可能不需要很长的推理，而困难问题可能从额外计算中受益。本项目研究如何让模型根据任务选择推理方式，而不是对所有输入使用同样的过程。"}]},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"建议按以下顺序阅读："},{"t":"a","href":"#rh-2","ext":false,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"理解问题与方法"}]},{"t":"text","v":" → "},{"t":"a","href":"#rh-58","ext":false,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"准备环境与输入"}]},{"t":"text","v":" → "},{"t":"a","href":"#rh-59","ext":false,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"按照步骤完成实验"}]},{"t":"text","v":" → "},{"t":"a","href":"#rh-60","ext":false,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"分析结果与形成判断"}]},{"t":"text","v":" → "},{"t":"a","href":"#rh-63","ext":false,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"阅读实现与继续探索"}]},{"t":"text","v":"。"}]},{"kind":"heading","depth":3,"text":"理解问题与方法","id":"rh-2"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"训练比较带推理与直接回答的样本，并在质量约束下调整行为。这里的关键是质量与计算投入之间的关系：回答更短可能更高效，也可能只是遗漏了必要步骤。"}]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"AdaptThink: 让推理模型学会何时思考","id":"rh-3"},{"kind":"quote","c":[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"历史非规范说明。"}]},{"t":"text","v":" 本长篇说明保留作方法背景；其中取整趋势、横向比较和成本估算不属于实验 8-10 的规范结果。若与文首内容冲突，以训练报告及精确 step-300 表格为准。"}]}]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"📋 目录","id":"rh-4"},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"a","href":"#rh-5","ext":false,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"项目简介"}]}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"a","href":"#rh-8","ext":false,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"核心原理"}]}]},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"a","href":"#rh-9","ext":false,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"研究动机"}]}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"a","href":"#rh-10","ext":false,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"方法设计"}]}]}]]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"a","href":"#rh-14","ext":false,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"实验设置"}]}]},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"a","href":"#rh-15","ext":false,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"模型与数据"}]}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"a","href":"#rh-19","ext":false,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"训练配置"}]}]}]]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"a","href":"#rh-21","ext":false,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"实验结果分析"}]}]},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"a","href":"#rh-22","ext":false,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"整体性能表现"}]}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"a","href":"#rh-24","ext":false,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"训练过程分析"}]}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"a","href":"#rh-30","ext":false,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"不同难度的自适应行为"}]}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"a","href":"#rh-32","ext":false,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"效率与准确率的权衡"}]}]}]]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"a","href":"#rh-34","ext":false,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"操作指南"}]}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"a","href":"#rh-41","ext":false,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"关键发现"}]}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"a","href":"#rh-53","ext":false,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"参考资源"}]}]}]]},{"kind":"hr"},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"项目简介","id":"rh-5"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"AdaptThink"}]},{"t":"text","v":" 是一种创新的强化学习算法，旨在教会大型推理模型（Large Reasoning Models, LRMs）根据问题难度"},{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"自适应选择推理模式"}]},{"t":"text","v":"。"}]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"背景问题","id":"rh-6"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"当前的推理模型（如 OpenAI o1、DeepSeek-R1）在处理问题时会进行长时间的\"思考\"（Thinking），这种深度推理虽然提升了复杂任务的表现，但也带来了显著问题："}]},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"高推理成本"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：长思考链导致 token 消耗大幅增加"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"高延迟"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：即使简单问题也需要冗长的思考过程"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"效率低下"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：许多简单问题并不需要复杂推理"}]}]]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"本项目采用的方法","id":"rh-7"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"AdaptThink 让模型学会在两种模式间智能切换："}]},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Thinking 模式"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：生成详细的思考链（"},{"t":"code","v":"<think>...</think>"},{"t":"text","v":"）来解决复杂问题"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"NoThinking 模式"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：跳过思考过程，直接生成答案来处理简单问题"}]}]]},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"在保留的 step-300 结果中，这一机制"},{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"大幅降低平均响应长度"}]},{"t":"text","v":"，但不同数据集的准确率变化有正有负。"}]},{"kind":"hr"},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"核心原理","id":"rh-8"},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"研究动机","id":"rh-9"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"论文首先通过实验发现了一个关键现象："}]},{"kind":"quote","c":[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"对于相对简单的问题（高中竞赛级别以下），NoThinking 模式的性能与 Thinking 模式相当甚至更优，同时显著减少了 token 使用量。只有当问题足够困难时，Thinking 的优势才会显现。"}]}]}]},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"这一发现启发了核心研究问题："}]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"方法设计","id":"rh-10"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"AdaptThink 通过两个核心组件实现自适应推理："}]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"1. 约束优化目标（Constrained Optimization）","id":"rh-11"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"math","v":"\\max_{\\theta} \\mathbb{E}_{x \\sim \\mathcal{D}, y \\sim \\pi_\\theta(y|x)} [r(x,y)] \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad \\mathbb{E}_{x \\sim \\mathcal{D}, y \\sim \\pi_\\theta(y|x)} [r(x,y)] \\geq \\mathbb{E}_{x \\sim \\mathcal{D}, y \\sim \\pi_{\\text{ref}}(y|x)} [r(x,y)] - \\delta","display":false,"html":"<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.1052em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"