tems":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"math","v":"r(x,y)","display":false,"html":"<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>"},{"t":"text","v":" 是奖励函数（基于答案准确性）"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"math","v":"\\pi_{\\text{ref}}","display":false,"html":"<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>"},{"t":"text","v":" 是参考模型（原始推理模型）"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"math","v":"\\delta","display":false,"html":"<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span>"},{"t":"text","v":" 是允许的性能降幅（本实验设为 0.05）"}]}]]},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"核心思想"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：在保证整体性能不低于参考模型（允许轻微降幅 "},{"t":"math","v":"\\delta","display":false,"html":"<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span>"},{"t":"text","v":"）的前提下，最大化奖励。下述独立采样策略让训练同时看到 Thinking 与 NoThinking 响应；这里展示的约束目标本身不含 KL 散度项或 token 成本项。"}]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"2. 重要性采样策略（Importance Sampling）","id":"rh-12"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"在训练过程中，为了平衡 Thinking 和 NoThinking 样本："}]},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"冷启动阶段"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：模型倾向于使用 Thinking（因为这是其预训练行为）"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"采样策略"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：引入重要性采样，确保训练过程中既有 Thinking 也有 NoThinking 样本"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"探索与利用"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：让模型在整个训练过程中持续探索两种模式"}]}]]},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"具体实现：对每个问题，同时采样 Thinking 和 NoThinking 响应，并根据其性能动态调整采样权重。"}]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"3. NoThinking 实现","id":"rh-13"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"通过在输入提示中添加空的 think 标签来实现："}]},{"kind":"code","lang":"text","html":"<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>User: [问题]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Assistant: &#x3C;think>&#x3C;/think>[直接答案]</span></span></code></pre>"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"这种简洁的实现方式利用了模型的预训练知识，让模型理解\"跳过思考\"的语义。"}]},{"kind":"hr"},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"实验设置","id":"rh-14"},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"模型与数据","id":"rh-15"},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"基座模型","id":"rh-16"},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B"}]},{"t":"text","v":"（本次实验）"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B（论文中的对比实验）"}]}]]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"训练数据集","id":"rh-17"},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"DeepScaler"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：40,000 个数学问题，涵盖从小学到高中竞赛的多个难度级别"}]}]]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"评估数据集","id":"rh-18"},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"GSM8K"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：小学数学问题"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"MATH500"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：竞赛级数学问题（分为 Level 1-5）"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"AIME2024"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：美国高中数学竞赛（最难）"}]}]]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"训练配置","id":"rh-19"},{"kind":"table","align":[null,null],"header":[[{"t":"text","v":"参数"}],[{"t":"text","v":"值"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"text","v":"上下文长度"}],[{"t":"text","v":"16K tokens"}]],[[{"t":"text","v":"批次大小"}],[{"t":"text","v":"128"}]],[[{"t":"text","v":"学习率"}],[{"t":"text","v":"2e-6"}]],[[{"t":"text","v":"配置计划"}],[{"t":"text","v":"10 epochs（计划 3,140 steps）；运行在 step 410 后崩溃"}]],[[{"t":"text","v":"δ（性能容忍度）"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0.05"}]],[[{"t":"text","v":"硬件配置"}],[{"t":"text","v":"8 × NVIDIA H100 80GB，CUDA 12.6"}]],[[{"t":"text","v":"记录时长"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Step 300 为 28.37 小时；至 step 410 为 36.92 小时"}]],[[{"t":"text","v":"报告选点"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Step 300；checkpoint 不随书分发"}]]]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"参考模型预采样","id":"rh-20"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"训练前需要对参考模型进行预采样以评估实例级准确率："}]},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"每个训练问题采样 16 个响应"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"计算每个问题的准确率作为难度指标"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"用于重要性采样的权重计算"}]}]]},{"kind":"hr"},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"实验结果分析","id":"rh-21"},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"整体性能表现","id":"rh-22"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"根据本次实验（1.5B 模型，δ=0.05）的 WandB 监控数据："},{"t":"a","href":"https://wandb.ai/bojieli-pine-ai/adapt_think_verl/","ext":true,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"https://wandb.ai/bojieli-pine-ai/adapt_think_verl/"}]}]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"核心指标对比","id":"rh-23"},{"kind":"table","align":[null,null,null,null],"header":[[{"t":"text","v":"数据集"}],[{"t":"text","v":"准确率，step 0 → 300"}],[{"t":"text","v":"响应长度，step 0 → 300"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Step-300 NoThinking"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"text","v":"GSM8K"}],[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"0.796816 → 0.818802"}]},{"t":"text","v":"（+2.20 pp）"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1025.24 → 477.33（-53.44%）"}],[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"84.15%"}]}]],[[{"t":"text","v":"MATH500"}],[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"0.8100 → 0.8180"}]},{"t":"text","v":"（+0.80 pp）"}],[{"t":"text","v":"4911.46 → 1576.62（-67.90%）"}],[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"83.80%"}]}]],[[{"t":"text","v":"AIME2024 mean@16"}],[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"0.314583 → 0.310417"}]},{"t":"text","v":"（-0.42 pp）"}],[{"t":"text","v":"12119.51 → 6402.23（-47.17%）"}],[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"56.25%"}]}]]]},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"关键成果"}]},{"t":"text","v":"："}]},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"准确率结果有正有负"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：MATH500 提升 0.80 pp，GSM8K 提升 2.20 pp，AIME mean@16 下降 0.42 pp"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"效率显著提升"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：MATH500、GSM8K、AIME 的平均响应长度分别下降 67.90%、53.44%、47.17%"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"数据集层面的路由信号"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：AIME 的 NoThinking 比例为 56.25%，低于 MATH500/GSM8K；这与难度敏感路由一致，但不能证明逐题“完美感知”"}]}]]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"训练过程分析","id":"rh-24"},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"1. 响应长度的演变","id":"rh-25"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"从 WandB 图表 "},{"t":"code","v":"response_length/mean"},{"t":"text","v":" 和各数据集的响应长度可以观察到清晰的三阶段模式："}]},{"kind":"code","lang":"text","html":"<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>初始阶段 (Step 0-50):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 整体平均响应长度：~5,500 tokens</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - MATH500: ~5,000 tokens (几乎全部 Thinking)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - GSM8K: ~1,600 tokens (几乎全部 Thinking)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - AIME: ~12,000 tokens (复杂问题的长思考链)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 模型延续预训练行为，对所有问题都进行思考</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>过渡阶段 (Step 50-150):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 整体急剧下降至 ~4,000 tokens</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - is_nothinking 比例开始上升（从 0 → 0.5+）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - NoThinking 准确率快速涌现（MATH500: 0 → 0.8）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 模型学习区分问题难度的关键时期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>稳定阶段 (Step 150-300):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 整体稳定在 ~3,000-3,500 tokens</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - MATH500: 降至 ~1,800 tokens (80% NoThinking)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - GSM8K: 降至 ~500 tokens (85% NoThinking)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - AIME: 降至 ~9,000 tokens (55% NoThinking)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - NoThinking 路由已经形成；不同数据集的准确率并非都持续提升</span></span></code></pre>"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"关键观察"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：保留的汇总数据与难度敏感路由一致，但不能证明响应长度与逐题难度完美匹配。"}]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"2. 准确率的演变与 NoThinking 能力涌现","id":"rh-26"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"GSM8K（简单数学）"}]},{"t":"text","v":"："}]},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"报告选点 score/mean"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：0.796816 → "},{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"0.818802"}]},{"t":"text","v":"（+2.20 pp）"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"nothinking_acc"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：在 Step 150 左右从 0 快速上升至 "},{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"0.88-0.90"}]}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"报告选点 is_nothinking"}]},{"t":"text","v":"："},{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"84.15%"}]}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"关键发现"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：step 300 汇总中，84.15% 的 GSM8K 样本使用 NoThinking"}]}]]},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"MATH500（中等数学）"}]},{"t":"text","v":"："}]},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"报告选点 score/mean"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：0.8100 → "},{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"0.8180"}]},{"t":"text","v":"（+0.80 pp）"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"thinking_acc"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：稳定在 0.5-0.65 之间（模型选择的困难题目）"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"nothinking_acc"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：在 Step 150 时快速涌现，从 0 跃升至 "},{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"0.8-0.85"}]},{"t":"text","v":"（模型选择的简单题目）"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"报告选点 is_nothinking"}]},{"t":"text","v":"："},{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"83.80%"}]}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"关键发现"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：step 300 汇总中，83.80% 的 MATH500 样本使用 NoThinking"}]}]]},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"AIME2024（困难数学）"}]},{"t":"text","v":"："}]},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"报告选点 score/mean@16"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：0.314583 → "},{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"0.310417"}]},{"t":"text","v":"（-0.42 pp）"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"thinking_acc"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：在 0.3-0.7 之间波动较大"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"nothinking_acc"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：从 0.3 逐渐提升至 0.4-0.6"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"报告选点 is_nothinking/mean@16"}]},{"t":"text","v":"："},{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"56.25%"}]},{"t":"text","v":"，低于另外两个数据集"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"关键发现"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：报告选点的 AIME 更常使用 Thinking，但准确率略有回退"}]}]]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"2.1 NoThinking 能力的涌现现象","id":"rh-27"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"从图表 "},{"t":"code","v":"nothinking_acc/mean"},{"t":"text","v":" 可以清晰观察到一个令人惊讶的现象："}]},{"kind":"code","lang":"text","html":"<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Step 0-150:   nothinking_acc ≈ 0 或未定义（几乎没有 NoThinking 样本）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Step 150:     急剧上升的拐点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Step 150-300: nothinking_acc ≈ 0.8-0.85 (MATH500), 0.88-0.90 (GSM8K)</span></span></code></pre>"}],"codeFiles":[]}